      "id": 241855,
      "name": "OddballPaladin",
      "username": "OddballPaladin",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/o/d26b3c/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2022-01-04T16:25:05.190Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I am so happy to have DE in my hands, yesterday. Was rather… miffed at FedEx for a day’s delay, but that’s actually fairly mild for their usual level of incompetence.</p>\n<p>Can’t wait to see what’s in Rook City. “Dark Watch and Friends… and Foes” is interesting. Besides the 5 members of the team (based on their answer to my question, I’m assuming Harpy will be in it), I wonder what other heroes will be there. Maybe Parse? If Nightmist is there, Gloomweaver will probably be there, too. Will Apostate be there, to fill out the original “Infernal Relics” set?</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2022-01-04T16:30:02.258Z",
      "reply_count": 1,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
