      "username": "Trajector",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
      "created_at": "2022-01-04T16:38:26.698Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Excuse me. <em>EXCUSE ME.</em> There is a smooth jazz sax remix of the Christopher and Adam Reading Letters to You song??? Jean-Marc is too funny!</p>\n<p>So, “Rook City Renegades?” That being the name of the RC baseball team, I’m expecting to get some Bottom of the 9th crossover action. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=10\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"></p>\n<p>I was thrilled to get the FedEx shipping notice last Wednesday, but it’s still only on the “label created” step. Oh, well. No sense getting worked up about something that I wasn’t expecting to get for another month or two anyway. I’m looking forward to cracking that box open soon!</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2022-01-04T16:39:29.302Z",
