      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Trajector\" data-post=\"4\" data-topic=\"29008\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/48/1914_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Trajector:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>So, “Rook City Renegades?” That being the name of the RC baseball team, I’m expecting to get some Bottom of the 9th crossover action. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=12\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>As much as I would love some baseball references…</p>\n<p>My memory is that in-universe “Rook City Renegades” being the name of the team was a wink and nod to <em>Rook City Renegades</em> already being a comic about various superheroes in Rook City (and I think them being the baseball team might have been an off-the-cuff joke in the Letters Page?) A bunch of the “Wraith and Parse Vs. Spite” storyline where Spite died was Rook City Renegades, IIRC, as were early appearances by Expatriette and Mr. Fixer.</p>",
